our development tools and Windows store temporary files.</p><blockquote data-path-to-node="4"><p data-path-to-node="4,0">üí° <i data-path-to-node="4,0" data-index-in-node="3">Note: <code data-path-to-node="4,0" data-index-in-node="9">%USERPROFILE%</code> and <code data-path-to-node="4,0" data-index-in-node="27">%LocalAppData%</code> are Windows shortcuts that automatically point to your specific user folder (e.g., <code data-path-to-node="4,0" data-index-in-node="125">C:\Users\YourName</code>).</i></p></blockquote><div class="horizontal-scroll-wrapper"><div class="table-block-component"><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><table-block _nghost-ng-c1676940566="" class="enable-luminous-table-block ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1676940566="" class="table-block has-export-button new-table-style has-scrollbar is-at-scroll-start"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1676940566="" not-end-of-paragraph="" class="table-content" jslog="275421;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQ3ecQahcKEwjlssaSjMiVAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQKw"><table data-path-to-node="5"><thead><tr><th><span data-path-to-node="5,0,0,0">Tool / System</span></th><th><span data-path-to-node="5,0,1,0">Default Folder Path</span></th><th><span data-path-to-node="5,0,2,0">What's Inside?</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">NPM Cache</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,1,1,0"><code data-path-to-node="5,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">%USERPROFILE%\AppData\Local\npm-cache</code></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,1,2,0">Cached copies of downloaded packages.</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">NPM Temp Files</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,2,1,0"><code data-path-to-node="5,2,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">%USERPROFILE%\AppData\Local\Temp</code></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,2,2,0">Temporary build files from Vite/NPM.</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,3,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Windows Temp</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,3,1,0"><code data-path-to-node="5,3,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">C:\Windows\Temp</code></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,3,2,0">System-level temporary junk.</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,4,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">User Temp</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,4,1,0"><code data-path-to-node="5,4,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">%LocalAppData%\Temp</code></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,4,2,0">App-level temporary junk.</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,5,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,5,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Prefetch Cache</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,5,1,0"><code data-path-to-node="5,5,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">C:\Windows\Prefetch</code></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,5,2,0">System optimization files that clog up over time.</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c1676940566="" hide-from-message-actions="" class="table-footer hide-on-print hide-from-message-actions"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c1676940566="" tabindex="0" gemmenutrigger="" cdkoverlayorigin="" theme="lm" type="tonal" arialabel="More options" gemtooltip="More options" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger overflow-menu-button gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-tonal lm-enabled is-mobile ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2208423640="" aria-disabled="false" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="ng-menu-a17866-11" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-18" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c2208423640="" maticonbutton="" matbadgeposition="after" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="More options" jslog="305704;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2208423640="" _nghost-ng-c3459726168=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3459726168="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-l lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="more_horiz" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="more_horiz"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><gem-popover _ngcontent-ng-c1676940566="" _nghost-ng-c3711289349="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></gem-popover><!----><!----></div></div><!----></table-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div></div><p data-path-to-node="6"><i data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="0">(Note on <code data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="9">node_modules</code>: Because your project folders are scattered wherever you save your code, they don't live in one single system directory. We will target system caches instead).</i></p><h2 data-path-to-node="8">üõ†Ô∏è The Ultimate Cleanup Batch File</h2><p data-path-to-node="9">Follow these steps to create your one-click cleaner.</p><h3 data-path-to-node="10">Step 1: Create the <code data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="19">.bat</code> File</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="11"><li><p data-path-to-node="11,0,0">Open <b data-path-to-node="11,0,0" data-index-in-node="5">Notepad</b> (or VS Code).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="11,1,0">Copy and paste the exact code below:</p></li></ol><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2911514074="" class="ng-tns-c2911514074-37 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2911514074="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2911514074-37 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_35e4ab5c4c51d017&quot;,&quot;c_600683a3d3dbb7f3&quot;,null,&quot;rc_5935d92a0de306b8&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahcKEwjlssaSjMiVAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQLQ" style="display: block;"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2911514074="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2911514074-37"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2911514074="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2911514074-37"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2911514074="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c2911514074-37 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2911514074="" class="ng-tns-c2911514074-37">Code snippet</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2911514074="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2911514074-37 ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c2911514074="" tabindex="-1" type="onSurface" size="small" fonticonname="arrow_circle_down" theme="lm" arialabel="Download code" gemtooltip="Download code" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c2911514074-37 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled is-mobile ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2208423640="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-15" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c2208423640="" maticonbutton="" matbadgeposition="after" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="Download code" jslog="305704;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2208423640="" _nghost-ng-c3459726168=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3459726168="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-l lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="arrow_circle_down" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="arrow_circle_down"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c2911514074="" tabindex="-1" type="onSurface" size="small" fonticonname="copy" theme="lm" arialabel="Copy code" gemtooltip="Copy code" data-test-id="gem-copy-button" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2911514074-37 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled is-mobile ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2208423640="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-16" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c2208423640="" maticonbutton="" matbadgeposition="after" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="Copy code" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_35e4ab5c4c51d017&quot;,&quot;c_600683a3d3dbb7f3&quot;,null,&quot;rc_5935d92a0de306b8&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2208423640="" _nghost-ng-c3459726168=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3459726168="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-l lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="copy" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="copy"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2911514074="" class="ng-tns-c2911514074-37"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2911514074="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2911514074-37">@echo off
:: Check for Admin rights (required to clean system folders)
net session &gt;nul 2&gt;&amp;1
if %errorLevel% == 0 (
    echo [INFO] Running with administrator privileges...
) else (
    echo [ERROR] Please right-click this file and select "Run as administrator".
    pause
    exit /b
)

echo ------------------------------------------
echo       STARTING WEB DEV &amp; WINDOWS CLEANUP  
echo ------------------------------------------

echo [1/5] Clearing NPM Cache...
call npm cache clean --force

echo [2/5] Cleaning Local User Temp Files...
del /q /f /s "%LocalAppData%\Temp\*.*" 2&gt;nul
for /d %%x in ("%LocalAppData%\Temp\*") do rmdir /s /q "%%x" 2&gt;nul

echo [3/5] Cleaning Windows System Temp Files...
del /q /f /s "C:\Windows\Temp\*.*" 2&gt;nul
for /d %%x in ("C:\Windows\Temp\*") do rmdir /s /q "%%x" 2&gt;nul

echo [4/5] Cleaning Windows Prefetch Cache...
del /q /f /s "C:\Windows\Prefetch\*.*" 2&gt;nul
for /d %%x in ("C:\Windows\Prefetch\*") do rmdir /s /q "%%x" 2&gt;nul

echo [5/5] Flushing DNS Cache...
ipconfig /flushdns

echo ------------------------------------------
echo               CLEANUP COMPLETE!           
echo ------------------------------------------
pause
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 data-path-to-node="13">Step 2: Save and Run It</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="14"><li><p data-path-to-node="14,0,0">In Notepad, go to <b data-path-to-node="14,0,0" data-index-in-node="18">File &gt; Save As</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,1,0">Change "Save as type" to <b data-path-to-node="14,1,0" data-index-in-node="25">All Files (<i data-path-to-node="14,1,0" data-index-in-node="36">.</i>)</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,2,0">Name the file <code data-path-to-node="14,2,0" data-index-in-node="14">dev_cleanup.bat</code> and save it to your Desktop.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="14,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">CRITICAL:</b> Right-click the <code data-path-to-node="14,3,0" data-index-in-node="26">dev_cleanup.bat</code> file on your desktop and select <b data-path-to-node="14,3,0" data-index-in-node="74">Run as administrator</b>. (If you don't run it as admin, Windows will block it from clearing the system temp folders).</p></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node="16">‚ö†Ô∏è One Quick Warning for your MongoDB</h3><p data-path-to-node="17">This batch script intentionally <b data-path-to-node="17" data-index-in-node="32">does not</b> touch your MongoDB directories. Local MongoDB databases usually store actual project data in <code data-path-to-node="17" data-index-in-node="134">C:\data\db</code> or <code data-path-to-node="17" data-index-in-node="148">C:\Program Files\MongoDB</code>. Automatically deleting things there could destroy your active databases.</p><p data-path-to-node="18">If you want to free up space from MongoDB, open <b data-path-to-node="18" data-index-in-node="48">MongoDB Compass</b>, look at your databases, and manually drop/delete any old, unused test databases you built for past projects!</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1916596297="" class="response-footer complete is-mobile gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1916596297="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1916596297="" _nghost-ng-c3453717024="" style="display: none;" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1916596297="" _nghost-ng-c1048235422="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c4131263072="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c4131263072-15 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1916596297="" footer="" class="hide-on-print ng-tns-c1256094186-16 hide-action-bar ng-tns-c4131263072-15 ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1256094186=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c1256094186="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c1256094186-16 mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1256094186="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c1256094186-16 ng-star-inserted"><thumb-up-button _ngcontent-ng-c1256094186="" _nghost-ng-c4269877486="" class="ng-tns-c1256094186-16 luminous-theme ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c4269877486="" tabindex="-1" theme="lm" type="onSurface" arialabel="Good response" gemtooltip="Good response" data-test-id="thumb-up-b