401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4131263072="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c4131263072-17 is-mobile"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1916596297="" class="response-content ng-tns-c4131263072-17"><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1916596297="" _nghost-ng-c3909110362="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1916596297="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false"><!----><!----><h2 _ngcontent-ng-c1916596297="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted" style=""> Gemini said </h2><!----><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c1916596297="" class="model-response-text is-mobile processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1632122541="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1632122541="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c1632122541="" _nghost-ng-c2728394718="" id="message-content-id-r_e70be6a089b283d7" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2728394718="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color tutor-markdown-rendering" id="model-response-message-contentr_e70be6a089b283d7" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">I completely get your frustration. There is nothing worse than trying to code, only to have your internet lag or your C drive fill up because Windows is silently downloading gigabytes of updates in the background.</p><p data-path-to-node="1"><b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="0">Delivery Optimization</b> is notorious for this‚Äîit essentially turns your PC into a peer-to-peer (P2P) server, uploading updates to <i data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="128">other</i> computers on the internet or your local network without you realizing it.</p><p data-path-to-node="2">Let‚Äôs shut down Delivery Optimization permanently, stop Windows from hogging your bandwidth/disk space, and disable other rogue software update services.</p><h2 data-path-to-node="4">üõ†Ô∏è Step 1: Kill "Delivery Optimization" Permanently</h2><p data-path-to-node="5">This stops Windows from using your drive and bandwidth to share updates.</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="6"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,0,0">Press <code data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="6">Win + I</code> to open <b data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="22">Settings</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,1,0">Go to <b data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="6">Update &amp; Security</b> &gt; <b data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="26">Delivery Optimization</b> (On Windows 11: <b data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="64">Windows Update</b> &gt; <b data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="81">Advanced options</b> &gt; <b data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="100">Delivery Optimization</b>).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,2,0">Turn <b data-path-to-node="6,2,0" data-index-in-node="5">OFF</b> the switch that says <b data-path-to-node="6,2,0" data-index-in-node="30">"Allow downloads from other PCs"</b>.</p></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node="7">The Advanced Registry Fix (Ensures it stays dead)</h3><p data-path-to-node="8">Sometimes Windows ignores that switch. To kill the service entirely:</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="9"><li><p data-path-to-node="9,0,0">Press <code data-path-to-node="9,0,0" data-index-in-node="6">Win + R</code>, type <code data-path-to-node="9,0,0" data-index-in-node="20">regedit</code>, and hit Enter.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,1,0">Navigate to this folder path in the sidebar:
<code data-path-to-node="9,1,0" data-index-in-node="45">HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\DoSvc</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,2,0">Look for a file on the right side named <b data-path-to-node="9,2,0" data-index-in-node="40">Start</b>. Double-click it.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,3,0">Change its value from <code data-path-to-node="9,3,0" data-index-in-node="22">2</code> (Automatic) or <code data-path-to-node="9,3,0" data-index-in-node="39">3</code> (Manual) to <b data-path-to-node="9,3,0" data-index-in-node="53"><code data-path-to-node="9,3,0" data-index-in-node="53">4</code> (Disabled)</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,4,0">Restart your computer.</p></li></ol><h2 data-path-to-node="11">üõ†Ô∏è Step 2: Stop Software Update Services (Google, Edge, etc.)</h2><p data-path-to-node="12">Since you are a developer, background updaters for browsers (like Chrome or Edge) and tools are constantly running tasks. Let's disable them using Windows Services.</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="13"><li><p data-path-to-node="13,0,0">Press <code data-path-to-node="13,0,0" data-index-in-node="6">Win + R</code>, type <code data-path-to-node="13,0,0" data-index-in-node="20">services.msc</code>, and hit Enter.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="13,1,0">Scroll down and find the following services. For each one, <b data-path-to-node="13,1,0" data-index-in-node="59">Right-click &gt; Properties</b>, change the <i data-path-to-node="13,1,0" data-index-in-node="96">Startup type</i> to <b data-path-to-node="13,1,0" data-index-in-node="112">Disabled</b>, and click <b data-path-to-node="13,1,0" data-index-in-node="132">Stop</b>.</p></li></ol><ul data-path-to-node="14"><li><p data-path-to-node="14,0,0">‚ùå <b data-path-to-node="14,0,0" data-index-in-node="2">Windows Update</b> <i data-path-to-node="14,0,0" data-index-in-node="17">(Change to 'Manual' so it only runs when you click check for updates, or 'Disabled' to block completely).</i></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,1,0">‚ùå <b data-path-to-node="14,1,0" data-index-in-node="2">Google Update Service (gupdate)</b></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,2,0">‚ùå Google Update Service (gupdatem)</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,3,0">‚ùå <b data-path-to-node="14,3,0" data-index-in-node="2">Microsoft Edge Update Service (edgeupdate)</b></p></li></ul><h2 data-path-to-node="16">üõ†Ô∏è Step 3: Add These to Your Cleanup <code data-path-to-node="16" data-index-in-node="38">.bat</code> File</h2><p data-path-to-node="17">Since we already built a cleanup script, let's add a few lines to it that aggressively stops these update services and clears out the giant <b data-path-to-node="17" data-index-in-node="140">SoftwareDistribution</b> folder (where Windows hides pending update files that eat up C drive space).</p><p data-path-to-node="18">Right-click your <code data-path-to-node="18" data-index-in-node="17">dev_cleanup.bat</code> file, select <b data-path-to-node="18" data-index-in-node="46">Edit</b>, and paste this updated version:</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2911514074="" class="ng-tns-c2911514074-38 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2911514074="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2911514074-38 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_e70be6a089b283d7&quot;,&quot;c_600683a3d3dbb7f3&quot;,null,&quot;rc_dc21b55a1f842b22&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahcKEwjlssaSjMiVAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQLg" style="display: block;"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2911514074="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2911514074-38"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2911514074="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2911514074-38"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2911514074="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c2911514074-38 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2911514074="" class="ng-tns-c2911514074-38">Code snippet</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2911514074="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2911514074-38 ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c2911514074="" tabindex="-1" type="onSurface" size="small" fonticonname="arrow_circle_down" theme="lm" arialabel="Download code" gemtooltip="Download code" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c2911514074-38 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled is-mobile ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2208423640="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-15" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c2208423640="" maticonbutton="" matbadgeposition="after" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="Download code" jslog="305704;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2208423640="" _nghost-ng-c3459726168=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3459726168="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-l lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="arrow_circle_down" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="arrow_circle_down"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c2911514074="" tabindex="-1" type="onSurface" size="small" fonticonname="copy" theme="lm" arialabel="Copy code" gemtooltip="Copy code" data-test-id="gem-copy-button" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2911514074-38 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled is-mobile ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2208423640="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-16" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c2208423640="" maticonbutton="" matbadgeposition="after" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="Copy code" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_e70be6a089b283d7&quot;,&quot;c_600683a3d3dbb7f3&quot;,null,&quot;rc_dc21b55a1f842b22&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2208423640="" _nghost-ng-c3459726168=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3459726168="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-l lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="copy" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="copy"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2911514074="" class="ng-tns-c2911514074-38"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2911514074="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2911514074-38">@echo off
:: Check for Admin rights
net session &gt;nul 2&gt;&amp;1
if %errorLevel% == 0 (
    echo [INFO] Running with administrator privileges...
) else (
    echo [ERROR] Please right-click this file and select "Run as administrator".
    pause
    exit /b
)

echo ------------------------------------------
echo       STARTING AGGRESSIVE DEV &amp; UPDATE CLEANUP  
echo ------------------------------------------

echo [1/8] Stopping Update Services...
net stop wuauserv 2&gt;nul
net stop bits 2&gt;nul
net stop dosvc 2&gt;nul

echo [2/8] Clearing Windows Update Download Cache (SoftwareDistribution)...
del /q /f /s "C:\Windows\SoftwareDistribution\Download\*.*" 2&gt;nul
for /d %%x in ("C:\Windows\SoftwareDistribution\Download\*") do rmdir /s /q "%%x" 2&gt;nul

echo [3/8] Clearing NPM Cache...
call npm cache clean --force

echo [4/8] Cleaning Local User Temp Files...
del /q /f /s "%LocalAppData%\Temp\*.*" 2&gt;nul
for /d %%x in ("%LocalAppData%\Temp\*") do rmdir /s /q "%%x" 2&gt;nul

echo [5/8] Cleaning Windows System Temp Files...
del /q /f /s "C:\Windows\Temp\*.*" 2&gt;nul
for /d %%x in ("C:\Windows\Temp\*") do rmdir /s /q "%%x" 2&gt;nul

echo [6/8] Cleaning Windows Prefetch Cache...
del /q /f /s "C:\Windows\Prefetch\*.*" 2&gt;nul
for /d %%x in ("C:\Windows\Prefetch\*") do rmdir /s /q "%%x" 2&gt;nul

echo [7/8] Restarting essential update services in manual mode...
net start bits 2&gt;nul

echo [8/8] Flushing DNS Cache...
ipconfig /flushdns

echo ------------------------------------------
echo     DONE! Delivery Optimization Cache cleared.
echo ------------------------------------------
pause
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="20">Run this new version as Administrator. It will instantly stop Delivery Optimization (<code data-path-to-node="20" data-index-in-node="85">dosvc</code>), stop the Windows Update service (<code data-path-to-node="20" data-index-in-node="126">wuauserv</code>), and wipe out the hidden update installation files that were bloating your C drive!</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1916596297="" class="response-footer complete is-mobile gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1916596297="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1916596297="" _nghost-ng-c3453717024="" style="display: none;" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1916596297="" _nghost-ng-c1048235422="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c4131263072="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c4131263072-17 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1916596297="" footer="" class="hide-on-print ng-tns-c12560941